BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
50 760 Td
(Company property, confidential information, and intellectual property must be protected at all times.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
50 742 Td
(Use of company systems for unlawful, offensive, or unauthorized activity is prohibited.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 12 Tf
50 714 Td
(7. Information Security and Data Privacy) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
50 696 Td
(Employees must use strong passwords, enable required multi-factor authentication, and store sensitive files only in approved systems.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
50 678 Td
(Customer, employee, and company data may be accessed only for legitimate business purposes and must not be shared without authorization.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
50 660 Td
(Any suspected data breach, phishing attempt, or device loss must be reported to IT Security within one hour of discovery.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 12 Tf
50 632 Td
(8. Remote and Hybrid Work) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
50 614 Td
(Approved remote employees must maintain a secure, professional workspace and remain reachable during agreed working hours.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
50 596 Td
(Business meetings should be attended on time with appropriate professional conduct whether in person or virtual.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
50 578 Td
(Managers may revise remote work arrangements based on performance, team needs, security requirements, or business continuity needs.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 12 Tf
50 550 Td
(9. Performance Management) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
50 532 Td
(Employees will receive periodic feedback and a formal performance review at least once per year.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
50 514 Td
(Performance ratings may affect compensation changes, promotions, development plans, and eligibility for incentive programs.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
50 496 Td
(Employees are encouraged to work with their manager on measurable goals and professional development objectives.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 12 Tf
50 468 Td
(10. Reporting Concerns) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
50 450 Td
(Employees should report workplace concerns, ethics issues, safety hazards, or policy violations to their manager, HR, Compliance, or the anonymous ethics hotline.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
50 432 Td
(Retaliation against any employee who raises a good-faith concern or participates in an investigation is strictly prohibited.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 12 Tf
50 404 Td
(11. Disciplinary Action) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
50 386 Td
(Policy violations may result in verbal warning, written warning, suspension, loss of access privileges, or termination of employment depending on severity.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
50 368 Td
(The company reserves the right to investigate misconduct and take immediate action where required to protect people, assets, or operations.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 12 Tf
50 340 Td
(12. Employee Acknowledgment) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
50 322 Td
(All employees are expected to read, understand, and comply with this handbook and related policies issued by the Human Resources department.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
50 304 Td
(For questions, contact HR at hr@enterprise.example or extension 2400.) Tj
